  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "091df0b74039",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "8913af587b3d",
     "text": "Yes — Magic Kingdom is usually the best first Disney World park for families with young kids. It has a long list of rides with no height requirement, familiar characters, and a mix of calm dark rides and a few bigger thrills. The catch is that the big coasters and Tiana's Bayou Adventure do have height minimums, so measuring kids before you go saves a lot of line-time heartbreak.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
