     "href": "https://disneyworld.disney.go.com/guest-services/rider-switch/"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e00d7ce080bb",
     "text": "If one child is too short or not interested, Disney's ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "7d2fdc756a6d",
     "text": "Rider Switch",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ee9b67229d0a",
     "text": " lets one adult wait with the child while the other adult rides, then swap without waiting in the full standby line again (see ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "49e17c754230",
     "text": "Disney's Rider Switch page",
     "marks": [
      "f97c2488a3d2"
